            "review_text": "YowTran\nLondon, United Kingdom98 contributions\n0\nGreat swim and dine offer\nAug 2019 • Family\nThe hotel had a great offer which included the use of the hotel's pool when you had lunch. Daewoo has probably the best pool in Hanoi, so it was great to be able to relax and swim and then enjoy a really nice buffet lunch. The kids certainly enjoyed themselves. Under 4s are free but we managed to not have to pay for our 4 year old. The buffet had International cuisine as well as some Vietnamese. There was everything from roast lamb, sushi, grilled seafood, pasta, curry as well as an assortment of desserts. Food was of a high standard.\nRead more\nWritten August 26, 2019",
