            "review_text": "do_tlinh\nHanoi, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nWould return for sure!\nDec 2016 • Couples\nVery Good Food!!! Great Service. Great Location. The atmosphere was nice and cheerful and there were a lot of happy people there! Would return for sure.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 7, 2016\nHanoi Daewoo Hotel\nDear Ms. do_tlinh,\nFirst of all, I would like to thank you for spending your time to provide us this valuable feedbacks. We are happy to know that you have enjoyed our food and services at Cafe Promenade. We look forward to welcoming you again.\nYours sincerely,\nErwin Popov\nRead more\nWritten December 12, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
