            "review_text": "Viet T\nHanoi, Vietnam128 contributions\n0\nPlace for Buffet with family\nOct 2016 • Business\nWe occasionally go to this restaurant, especially at weekend when it serves more BBQ choices. Food is acceptable. Service is good. It overlooks the beautiful swimming pool of Daewoo Hotel so it is nice. If you want a relaxing dining place, here it is.\nWritten December 1, 2016\nHanoi Daewoo Hotel\nDear Mr. Viet T,\nFirst of all, I would like to thank you for having chosen Cafe Promenade to spend time with your family. We are happy to know that our food and services successfully bring your family good experience, especially you have enjoyed the view of our outdoor pool.\nWe look forward to welcoming you again.\nYours sincerely,\nErwin Popov\nRead more\nWritten December 7, 2016\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
